":\"Searched the web\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"23kifEfHsOGsYVzPa4zPxp\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"nights spent tourist accommodation europe 2024 by region eurostat\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":true}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"74vcsJV62bQ9LgPYgeIlWr\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"European Commission\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":false}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"1sBrh5U8ihqjfSxZYjFiwJ\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"Reuters\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":false}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"For the Asian locations, I'll need to gather occupancy data for Osaka, Da Nang, Ho Chi Minh City, and Bangkok. These cities seem like key candidates to explore further. I’ll gather the relevant statistics and see how they compare in terms of tourism and hotel performance. Once I have the numbers, I can pull everything together clearly for analysis.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"}],\"nodeType\":\"unordered-list\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Searched the web\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"5vEgGOuZJplWL9kok5t9xc\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"2024 hotel occupancy Tokyo 80% STR\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":true}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"mnwT0JdP541rALf7Cggiu\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"2024 hotel occupancy Osaka STR 2024 average occupancy\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":true}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"6qEpUg4JP8NR1V6yFBQnE9\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":3,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"2 more\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":false}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"I need to focus on one European city for expansion. Athens, Valencia, Warsaw, Budapest, Krakow, Dubrovnik, and Malaga are options, but let’s narrow it down to Athens or Valencia. Since the user wants a new country in Europe, Spain and Greece are strong contenders. Valencia has an 80-90% occupancy rate and solid economic indicators, while Athens shows strong growth in occupancy and RevPAR. In Asia, Osaka, Bangkok, and Da Nang are possibilities, but Osaka is seeing a tourism surge with about 76% occupancy.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"For Asia, Bangkok has a 74% occupancy rate for H1 2024 with 35.5 million international arrivals, but Da Nang has strong growth, even though occupancy is at 60-65%. Osaka could be a good choice—it’s less saturated than Tokyo and offers lower land costs. Fukuoka is another possibility, but Osaka has solid data trends. To analyze this properly, we’ll include Athens, Valencia, Budapest, Osaka, Bangkok, and Da Nang in a chart. The visualization will compare occupancy, RevPAR growth, and tourism arrivals.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"We have some estimated values for occupancy: Athens at 78%, Valencia at 85%, Budapest at 73%, Osaka at 74%, Bangkok at 74%, and Da Nang at 62%. Athens has a RevPAR growth of +11%, and Valencia is at +11.5%. Osaka should have high ADR, but we don’t have its RevPAR value—I'll focus on occupancy \u003e76 and rate growth. For tourism arrivals, I estimated Athens’ airport growth at 14% YoY, but I should confirm exact details for Athens tourism arrivals in 2024.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"}],\"nodeType\":\"unordered-list\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Searched the web\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"70HTDIPOfpgv3kXsvrr3S5\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"Athens International Airport passenger growth 2024 vs 2023\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":true}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"64C7TW5O3IH16x4f3GeKKe\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"Valencia airport passenger growth 2024 record\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":true}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"6BmdpUD0OkaRww4bDeBHWS\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"Osaka Kansai inbound tourism 2024 growth\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":true}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"5EmS9NMjgBxw5TAE43LRP2\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"AIA Media\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":false}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"2675G8VsPnU3rWBvqJ7i46\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"javeamigos.com\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":false}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"2iDFCb9jg4exxfxkrehcak\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"News on Japan\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":false}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"2rW6Ye2d5su87LmkMNY56w\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"7 more\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":false}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"We’ve got some useful airport passenger growth data now. To simplify, I’ll summarize the seasonal occupancy and other variables textually. I'll include key factors like GDP growth and unemployment for each city in a structured bullet-point format. For charts, I’m thinking of two bar charts: one for 2024 occupancy rate and one for tourism arrivals growth. I’ll also add a scatter chart for occupancy vs. passenger growth. I'll estimate values with disclaimers and provide citations for the numbers used.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"}],\"nodeType\":\"unordered-list\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Searched the web\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"5dK2z73WXddpiqZe5q1q7m\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"Osaka RevPAR growth 2024 hotel market\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":true}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"U8wXpgEgr4xcMfqL511Sb\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"Colliers\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":false}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"7mmq0mX83yQy1BmkBFHF9q\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"STR\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":false}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"7D9OAxaFEmhRaoZADqvMaO\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"HVS\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":false}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"dCh36hbWjwhIeNuDMP0fd\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"4 more\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":false}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"I’ve confirmed occupancy numbers for Osaka (79%) and Bangkok (74%) while Da Nang’s occupancy for luxury hotels is around 60-65%, so it might not be ideal. Osaka stands out, especially with the upcoming Expo 2025. For each city, I’ll include occupancy, RevPAR growth, and passenger growth figures. I’ll also consider aspects like currency exchange and infrastructure. I’d better search for Budapest’s airport traffic growth so we can finalize our recommendations based on the most accurate data.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"}],\"nodeType\":\"unordered-list\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Searched the web\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"2dPKQETcf7EoACcgmR33La\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"Budapest airport passenger traffic 2024 growth\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":true}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"72VSTGXEIyfdgNSiLiUIQ9\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":5,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"DailyNewsHungary\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":false}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"7e5xP31tWYgybcFJcguxC2\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGptCotSource\"}},\"locale\":\"en-US\"},\"fields\":{\"sourceText\":\"BudAPPest\",\"magnifyingGlassIcon\":false}}},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"embedded-entry-inline\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"target\":{\"metadata\":{\"tags\":[],\"concepts\":[]},\"sys\":{\"id\":\"rBWQvGodZbzMyAPTq7lU5\",\"type\":\"Entry\",\"publishedVersion\":4,\"revision\":2,\"contentType\":{\"sys\":{\"type\":\"Link\",\"linkType\":\"ContentType\",\"id\":\"chatGp